{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19913","headline":"秋怀 八 · 孟郊","name":"秋怀 八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岁莫景气乾，秋风兵甲声。\n织织劳无衣，喓喓徒自鸣。\n商声耸中夜，蹇支废前行。\n青发如秋园，一翦不复生。\n少年如饿花，瞥见不复明。\n君子山岳定，小人丝毫争。\n多争多无寿，天道戒其盈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19913.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19913","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}